    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96765" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῐβάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tread upon</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστίβακα:
				πεπάτηκα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>spread as bedding</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.67
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>follow the track, track out</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aesar.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστιβασμένος</span>
			<i>over-dressed</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυπαροφόρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Steph.
				<u>in Hp.</u>
				2.251
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i></div>
